/*
 * AV1onGPU - default probability tables for inter frames (generated)
 *
 * Generated by tools/gen_cdf_tables.py from the specification's annex of
 * default CDFs; do not edit. The tables are in the decoder's layout -
 * inverse cumulative, decreasing towards the last symbol, with the
 * adaptation counter after the last probability - which is the layout
 * RangeDecoder::read_symbol consumes and the one cdf_tables.hpp uses.
 *
 * The sizes are the specification's, so a row holds one entry more than
 * the number of probabilities it prints: the counter. A table's comment
 * names the contexts its dimensions index.
 */
